<title>USA: Wireless Broadcasting IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Wireless Broadcasting IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Wireless Broadcasting Inc has been postponed because of &quot;the sector being out of favor with the market,&quot; lead underwriter Prudential Securities said Thursday.</p>
<p>The Englewood, Co.-based telecommunications company filed to offer 2.4 million shares and was expected to price between $14 and $16 a share.</p>
<p>A representative of the syndicate department of Prudential Securities could not comment on the possibility of the IPO resurfacing.</p>
</text>
